  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a vibrant desert oasis with this stunning Jeminise cactus and floral printed quilt set. Featuring a lively blend of bright and bold colors, this quilt is designed to add a touch of nature-inspired beauty and cheer to your home, perfect for refreshing your décor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Cactus &amp; Floral Design:</strong> Adorned with a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, bringing a pop of nature-inspired beauty to any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting specific sizes or adding pillowcases and names to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), or King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> An ideal and unique gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates cheerful and vibrant bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable, ensuring easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functions beautifully as a bed quilt, a picnic mat, or a cozy throw blanket for various indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Quality Material:</strong> Features a breathable soft fabric outer layer with high-quality silk floss filling for comfortable use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Southwestern Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
